// # Science Comm -- Satellite DVB & GNSS
//
// Logline: Satellite digital video broadcasting (DVB-S2/S2X), GNSS positioning, and inter-satellite links. Phase 3.4 reorg: moved from std/phys/satellite_dvb/ (was communications engineering, not physics).
//
// Setup: Co-located module of 50 files under std/science/comm. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. DVB-S2/S2X family (frames, modcod, LDPC, BCH, GSE, VCM/ACM).
//   2. GNSS family (GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, BeiDou PRN generators, PVT solvers).
//   3. Satellite link budget and propagation (ITU-P recommendations).
//   4. Inter-satellite links (ISL laser/RF, routing).

